NOTICE

This skill distills and generalizes the retrieval-augmented Q&A workflow from
VaishnaviThakre/SupplyChain-AI (https://github.com/VaishnaviThakre/SupplyChain-AI),
Copyright (c) 2024 Vaishnavi Thakre, licensed under the MIT License above. The
ingest -> retrieve -> answer pattern is kept; the source repo's Chroma vector
store, HuggingFace embedding model, and Groq LLM call are replaced in this
skill with a zero-infrastructure SQLite FTS5 lexical index and in-conversation
answering, per references/retrieval-design.md.
